	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a deo, patre nostro, per dominum Iesum Christum in spiritu <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sancto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Accepi tuas litteras<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Nicht erhalten.</note>, doctissime et charissime <persName ref="p495">Bulinger</persName>e, in<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">in <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> mense decembri, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>in quibus video te ut multos alios bonos viros amantes reip[ublicae] et ecclesię in hisce <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>dissidiis publicis et bellicis tumultibus admodum animo angi et multa de ecclesiarum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>erumnis et perturbatione disciplinę et studiorum cogitare, nec immerito; testantur enim <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>non solum sacrę litterę, verum etiam omnes creaturę adesse tempora et postrema et <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>periculosissima, in quibus paulo ante resurrectionem futuras ingentes ecclesię ęrumnas <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>predixit Daniel<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Gedacht ist wohl vor allem an die Weissagungen in <cit type="bible"><ref>Dan 12, 1f</ref></cit>, die später auch für <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> eine wichtige Rolle spielten; s. Emidio <hi>Campi,</hi> Über das Ende des Weltzeitalters. Aspekte der Rezeption des Danielbuches bei <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>, in: Europa, Tausendjähriges Reich und Neue Welt. Zwei Jahrtausende Geschichte und Utopie in der Rezeption des Danielbuches, hg. v. Mariano Delgado u.a., Stuttgart 2003. - Studien zur christlichen Religions- und Kulturgeschichte 1, S. 225-238.</note> premonens nos, ut animo confirmemur, ne deficiamus a deo fracti vel <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>sevitia impiorum vel exemplis et iuditiis hypocritarum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quare tu sapienter et pie mo<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>nes, ut consolidemus nostrę fidei concreditos, ne a recepta semel veritate resiliant <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>persequutionum procellis obruti<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 13, 21</ref></cit>.</note>, cum oporteat per multas angustias et tribulationes <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ingredi regnum coelorum<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><cit type="bible"><ref>Apg 14, 22</ref></cit>.</note>, id quod sedulo nostris votis ac precibus universę<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">universae <hi>über nicht gestrichenem</hi> toti.</note> ecclesię precamur<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c">precamur <hi>über nicht gestrichenem</hi> optamus.</note>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Agnoscimus divina bonitate ecclesię erumnas, et propter gloriam dei et propriam salutem <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>atque publicam necessitatem pro modulo donorum nobis collatorum acrius incumbimus in <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>evangelii depraedicationem toto pectore deum invocantes<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl>, 1, 4, 26 (<bibl>ASD</bibl> II/1 428, <ref target="file10357">Nr. 326</ref>). - Vgl. auch <cit type="bible"><ref>Ps 119 (Vulg. 118), 145</ref></cit>.</note>, ut ecclesiam suam propter Christum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>conservet, defendat et augeat.<pb type="edition" next="183"/></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quod vero rarius ad vos scripsi, nulla alia causa, de<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>um testor, factum est, nisi quod noluerim meis ineruditis schedis vos gravioribus et <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>melioribus rebus occupatos impedire atque oneri esse.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">At nunc a te provocatus, cum rursus <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ad scribendum horteris (nam<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d">nam <hi>über einem gestrichenen, unlesbaren Wort.</hi></note> statuo contra humanitatem esse nullam gratitudinis s<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ignificationem praebere) constitui, quoties quoties<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">In Analogie zu: quotquot.</note> licet per tabelliones commodos, presertim <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>in nundinis <placeName ref="l157">Francofordianis</placeName>, ad vos dare litteras.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Fateor multam habere utilitatem collo<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>quia fratrum per litteras.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Verum ego non ignorans, quod curta domi meę sit suppellex<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Vgl. Persius, Saturae, 4, 52.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>tum litterarum tum donorum, non temere soleo interpellare viros eximiis et prestantibus <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>donis preditos, quorum dona amplector atque admiror, et sentencia, voluntate, confessione <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>me cum eis coniungo, siquidem deum vera Christi agnitione et fide invocant et idola <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>fugiunt<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>2Tim 2, 22</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>2Petr 2, 20</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>1Thess 1, 9</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Commendatio tua non modicum profuit adolescentibus; <persName ref="p8115">alter</persName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p8115">Johannes Pincier</persName>.</note> enim ecclesię <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>in <placeName ref="l2927">Wetter</placeName> pręfectus est,<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">als Diakon (zweiter Pfarrer); vgl. oben <ref target="file11933">Nr. 1887</ref>, Anm. 1.</note> <persName ref="p1456">alter</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p1456">Wigand Happel</persName>, der im Sommer 1543 <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> besucht hatte (s. <bibl source="b16">HBBW XIII</bibl> 155, 2-4) und sich damals in <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurt a. M.</placeName> und Umgebung sowie auch längere Zeit in <placeName ref="l311">Marburg</placeName>, wo er Studenten aus <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> kennenlernte, aufhielt; s. unten <ref target="file11935">Nr. 1889</ref>; 1984.</note>, modo ambiret conditionem aliquam, auxilio non destitue<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>retur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Nostrę res mediocri sunt in statu; liberi enim a stulta conciliatione<pb type="scan" next="27v."/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>religionis, qua hactenus perpetuo in comitiis vexati frustra sumus,<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p9046">Pistorius</persName> hatte 1540/41 an den Religionsgesprächen zu <placeName ref="l199">Hagenau</placeName>, <placeName ref="l569">Worms</placeName> und <placeName ref="l410">Regensburg</placeName> teilgenommen, erwartete allerdings wenig von solchen Verhandlungen; s. seinen Brief an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> vom 12. April 1541 (<bibl source="b14">HBBW XI</bibl>, <ref target="file11542">Nr. 1499</ref>).</note> domi nostrę <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ecclesiis nostris inservimus et propagare in hisce gloriam dei per Christum studemus, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>securi, quicquid de religione statuerint pontifices cum principibus, scientes <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>filium dei, qui a nobis invocatur, semper adesse ecclesię suę, quem in omnibus <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>periculis nos habituros defensorem constanter<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Hebr 7. 25</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>1Joh 2, 1</ref></cit>.</note> credimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Hisce vale, charissime et <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>summopere venerande <persName ref="p495">Bulingere</persName>, una cum symmistis omnibus atque <persName ref="p8171">Bibliandrum</persName> inhortare, <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ut talentum concreditum<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 25, 14-30</ref></cit>.</note> proferat atque in utilitatem ecclesię exponat.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant vos omnes nostri.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Ex <placeName ref="l157">Francofordia</placeName>, 7. aprilis anno domini 1544.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p9046">Ioannes Pistorius Niddanus</persName> ex animo tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo viro, egregia eruditione et pietate <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>prędito d. <persName ref="p495">Henrycho Bulingero</persName>, pastori <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName>, suo <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>domino plurimum colendo etc.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
